IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BPAYQRY.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT PAY-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-PAY-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS PAY-ID
        FILE STATUS IS WS-PAY-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD PAY-FILE.
01 PAY-REC.
   COPY "BPAYREC".

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PAY-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-PAY-ST PIC X(02).

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-PAY-ID PIC X(12).
01 BK-PAY-REC.
   COPY "BPAYREC".
01 LS-RC PIC X(02).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-PAY-ID BK-PAY-REC LS-RC.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-PAY-REC
    MOVE "00" TO LS-RC
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-PAY-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/pay.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-PAY-PATH
    OPEN INPUT PAY-FILE
    IF WS-PAY-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "35" TO LS-RC
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE LS-PAY-ID TO PAY-ID OF PAY-REC
    READ PAY-FILE
    IF WS-PAY-ST = "00"
        MOVE PAY-REC TO BK-PAY-REC
    ELSE
        MOVE "23" TO LS-RC
    END-IF
    CLOSE PAY-FILE
    GOBACK.
